# Listen results are HTML

When showing a pronunciation, a clip, an IPA, a respelling, or a comparison, write an HTML page and open it. Do not leave the audio only as a chat description.

- One page per request, under `runs/listen-<name>/index.html`.
- Each clip is an `<audio controls>` element with the IPA or respelling in text above it.
- Reuse audio that already exists. Do not resynthesize `data/gold_gemini_ipa/` to fill the page.
- The chat reply names the page and the result. The page is what they listen to.
